# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Admin Gmail Timetable Auto-Sync Secrets (GitHub Actions / Local Setup)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GMAIL_CLIENT_ID: OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID from Google Cloud Console
# GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET: OAuth 2.0 Client Secret from Google Cloud Console
# GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN: Admin Gmail OAuth refresh token (generated via scripts/admin-gmail-oauth-setup.mjs)
# FIREBASE_ADMIN_UID: Verified admin user UID (defaults to TngcyE1MF9ZLRIQYW25C7LefShp2)
# TIMETABLE_SYNC_ENABLED: Feature flag (false = dry-run only, true = enable live automated sync)
# TIMETABLE_SENDER_EMAIL: Expected sender email or domain filter (e.g. office.cse@chitkarauniversity.edu.in)
# TIMETABLE_SUBJECT_PREFIX: Subject line filter prefix (e.g. "Time Table:")
